course: dictionary
lesson: 14304
title: Numerical: to do with numbers
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Numerical means to do with numbers, or shown in numbers. You can see it in the sentence «Put the cards in numerical order.» The word numerical tells you the cards go by their number value, not by their colour or their name.
explain: «Numerical order» means in order of numbers, such as 1, 2, 3 and so on. The numbers 4, 9, 12 and 20 are in numerical order because they go from smallest to largest.
explain: In maths and science, you will often meet «numerical answer», an answer written as a number, and «numerical data», numbers you can count or measure. Numerically is the adverb: it means in a way that uses numbers.
fact: Numerical means to do with numbers or shown in numbers.
fact: «Numerical order» means in order of numbers, such as 1, 2, 3 and so on.
fact: «Numerical data» are numbers you can measure or count, not words or categories.
fact: «Numerical value» means the amount that a number stands for.
fact: Numerical has no comparative forms, so do not write more numerical or most numerical.
exercise: «Please put the page numbers in numerical order.» What does numerical order mean? | *Numbers arranged from smallest to largest | Things arranged by colour | Names arranged from A to Z | Words arranged from longest to shortest
exercise: In science, the children wrote «The results were numerical data: 12 cm, 15 cm and 18 cm.» What does numerical data mean? | Pictures of the experiment | Sentences about feelings | *Numbers that you can measure or count | Words that describe a colour
exercise: «Write your numerical answer in the box.» Which word in this sentence tells you the answer must be a number? | *numerical | box | answer | write
test: «The shoe sizes were listed in numerical order.» What is numerical order? | Names in A to Z order | *Numbers from smallest to largest | Words sorted by length | Things sorted by how much they cost
test: Ahmed says «numerical data» can be words like red or blue. Is he right? | Yes, but only for art lessons | Yes, any word is numerical data | *No, numerical data are numbers you can measure or count
exam: Which word means to do with numbers? | *Numerical | Verbal | Alphabetical | Vocal
